~C. The central idea is comfort, and the purpose is to tell citizens to rest.#This contradicts the speech. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
~D. The purpose is to entertain, and the central idea is that assemblies are noisy.#Unsupported. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
}
